course: dictionary
lesson: 4762
title: Househusband
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A househusband is a man who stays at home to look after the house and the children while his partner goes out to work. You can find the meaning by reading the words around it.
explain: The sentence «"Domestic engineer" is a joking name for a housewife, househusband or homemaker» gives you a clue. Housewife and homemaker are close in meaning, so all three words name someone who runs the home. Ask yourself: what word would fit? A man who stays home and does the housework.
explain: Everyday life shows the same idea. A dad who cooks, cleans and does the school run while his partner is at work is a househusband. Another name for one is a stay-at-home dad.
fact: Househusband is a noun. You can have one househusband, or two or more househusbands.
fact: «Househusband» means a man who stays at home to look after the house and children while his partner goes out to work.
fact: «Domestic engineer» is a joking name for a housewife, househusband or homemaker.
fact: Stay-at-home dad is another name for a househusband.
fact: Jobs at home, like cooking, cleaning and caring for children, can be done by anyone.
exercise: «"Domestic engineer" is a joking name for a housewife, househusband or homemaker.» What is a househusband? | *A man who stays at home to look after the house and children | A man who works in an office all day | A man who fixes cars at a garage | A boy who goes to school
exercise: Which other name means about the same as househusband? | Lorry driver | Headteacher | Gardener | *Stay-at-home dad
exercise: Mo's dad cooks, cleans and does the school run while Mo's mum is at work. What is Mo's dad? | A pilot | A postman | A teacher | *A househusband
test: In the sentence «"Domestic engineer" is a joking name for a housewife, househusband or homemaker», which word means the same kind of person as househusband? | Postman | Dentist | *Homemaker | Pilot
test: Ravi's dad stays home to look after the house and children while his mum works. What is Ravi's dad? | A chef at a restaurant | A lollipop man | A cleaner who visits once a week | *A househusband
exam: Which sentence best explains the word househusband? | A man who builds houses for other people | A husband who lives in a different house | *A man who stays at home to look after the house and children while his partner works | A man who sells houses
